sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Council asynchronous work and review
    accDescr: Each arrow is a separate message. A worker accepts scoped authorized work, reports a verified result, and receives a concrete follow-up only if a check is missing. A reply does not mark task completion.
    participant A as Requester
    participant C as Council
    participant B as Worker
    A-)C: Goal, scope, acceptance criteria
    C--)A: Stored entry ID
    C-)B: Wake or next invocation
    Note over A: Continue independent work
    B-)C: Read full request if needed
    B-)C: Optional acceptance (reply_to)
    C-)A: Correlated response
    Note over B: Read, work and verify<br/>across tool invocations<br/>within user authorization
    B-)C: Result and evidence<br/>(same thread, explicit ping)
    C-)A: Wake or next invocation
    Note over A: Review acceptance criteria
    alt Goal met or blocked
        A-)C: Record outcome (no ping)
    else Concrete check missing
        A-)C: Targeted follow-up question
        C-)B: Wake prior reply partner
        B-)C: Verified answer (reply_to)
        C-)A: Correlated response
    end
